OL,3,AState pension likely to rise by #488 a
OL,4,Ayear in April
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe state pension is expected to top
OL,7,F#13,000 next April, reigniting the
OL,8,Fdebate about its long-term
OL,9,Faffordability and generational
OL,10,Ffairness.
OL,12,FIt is expected to rise by #488 to
OL,13,F#13,036.40 a year, based on the latest
OL,14,Fofficial earnings figure released on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FThe so-called triple lock pension
OL,18,Fpolicy guarantees that annual payments
OL,19,Fwill increase by either average wage
OL,20,Fgrowth, inflation or 2.5% - whichever
OL,21,Fis highest.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
