OL,3,AState pension likely to rise by #488 a
OL,4,Ayear in April
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour made a manifesto pledge to keep
OL,7,Fthe triple lock, however economists
OL,8,Fhave warned about the cost of the
OL,9,Fpolicy and it will mean tough spending
OL,10,Fchoices in next month's Budget.
